Subject: [PATCH] Disguise and mask events and setters; a plugin's
 setDisplayName while masked or disguised changes the real display name


diff --git a/src/main/java/athena/server/AthenaServerImpl.java b/src/main/java/athena/server/AthenaServerImpl.java
index ffec406bc0549c3c6f21a5ffaf5b0b414fe135e7..73d6de4646c8ee7397d6050f2d897c258140465c 100644
